<form class="totalform help-on-hover help-box" data-method="POST" data-route="/admin/settings/dashboard"><div class="form-field text-field " data-type="text" style="--grid-area: title;"><label for="field-UID">Admin Dashboard Browser Title</label><div class="form-group"><input type="text" id="field-UID" name="title" placeholder="Total CMS Admin" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="Total CMS Admin" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The browser title displayed in admin dashboard pages. This appears in the browser tab and bookmarks. Leave at the default to use "{Site Name} Admin" whenever a site name is set.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: pagination;"><label for="field-UID">Dashboard Table Pagination</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="pagination" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="50" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="50" min="0" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The number of items to display per page in the dashboard table. Set the value to <code>0</code> to disable pagination. When set to <code>0</code>, all items will be displayed on a single page.</p></div><div class="form-field number-field " data-type="number" style="--grid-area: confirmCountdown;"><label for="field-UID">Confirmation Countdown (seconds)</label><div class="form-group"><input type="number" id="field-UID" name="confirmCountdown" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="5" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="3" min="0" max="30" autocomplete="nofill"/><div class="form-group-icon"></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Destructive confirmation dialogs (delete, reset, etc.) disable the confirm button for this many seconds, forcing the user to pause and read the message. Set to <code>0</code> to disable the countdown.</p></div><div class="form-field color-field " data-type="color" style="--grid-area: accent;"><label for="field-UID">Dashboard Accent Color</label><div class="form-group"><input id="field-UID" name="accent" type="color" aria-describedby="help-UID" value="#4d91e2"/></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">The accent color used throughout the admin dashboard.</p></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: keepIdOnDuplicate;"><label for="field-UID">Keep ID on Duplicate Object?</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="keepIdOnDuplicate" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID"/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Keep ID on Duplicate Object?</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">When enabled, duplicating an object will keep the original ID (user must change it manually before saving). When disabled (default), the ID field is cleared to allow autogen rules to work.</p></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: fullWidthForms;"><label for="field-UID">Full Width Object Forms</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="fullWidthForms" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID"/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Full Width Object Forms</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">When enabled, forms in the admin dashboard expand to fill the full available width instead of being capped at 800px.</p></div><div class="form-field toggle-field " data-type="toggle" style="--grid-area: inlineEditing;"><label for="field-UID">Inline Editing</label><div class="form-group"><div class="switch"><input id="field-UID" name="inlineEditing" type="checkbox" aria-describedby="help-UID" checked/><label for="field-UID" aria-hidden="true">Inline Editing</label></div></div><p class="help" id="help-UID">Master switch for editing values in place. Turning it off hides the pencil in every collection table and refuses inline saves for everyone, regardless of access groups. When it is on, access groups decide who may use it.</p></div><div class="form-field checklist-field  choice-field" data-type="checklist" style="--grid-area: moreMenu;--fieldset-grid-size:250px;" data-settings="{&quot;fieldGrid&quot;:&quot;250px&quot;,&quot;propertyOptions&quot;:&quot;navItems&quot;,&quot;sortOptions&quot;:false,&quot;mergeStoredValues&quot;:false}"><fieldset><legend>More Menu<button type="button" class="choice-field-toggle-all" title="Select all" aria-label="Select all"></button></legend><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-1" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="collections" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-1" class="checkbox-label">Collections</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-2" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="schemas" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-2" class="checkbox-label">Schemas</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-3" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="dataviews" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-3" class="checkbox-label">Data Views</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-4" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="builder" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-4" class="checkbox-label">Builder</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-5" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="mailer" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-5" class="checkbox-label">Mailer</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-6" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="automations" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-6" class="checkbox-label">Automations</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-7" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="playground" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-7" class="checkbox-label">Playground</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-8" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="utils" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-8" class="checkbox-label">Utils</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-9" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="extensions" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-9" class="checkbox-label">Extensions</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-10" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="settings" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-10" class="checkbox-label">Settings</label></div><div class="checkbox"><input id="field-UID-11" name="moreMenu" type="checkbox" value="docs" aria-describedby="help-UID" class="checkbox"/><label for="field-UID-11" class="checkbox-label">Docs</label></div></fieldset><p class="help" id="help-UID">Sidebar items you rarely use. Checked items leave the sidebar and move into the <strong>More</strong> (&#8942;) menu at the bottom of it, where they stay one click away. Items added by extensions are listed here too.</p></div><div class="form-inline-fields"><button type="submit" class="button btn cms-save cms-button">Save Settings</button></div></form>